    "_about": "THE CHAMOIS (Rupicapra rupicapra; 2026-11-06, gen: scratchpad sc/new6/chamois.py, the deer frame's cervid sculpt): a stocky, agile goat-antelope of 0.75 m at the shoulder on sturdy legs; a short face, white-cream, a black stripe from the base of the ear through the eye down to the corner of the mouth on each side; short black horns rising straight from the brow and hooking sharply back at the tips; brown (summer) to near black (winter), a dark stripe along the spine, the legs dark, a pale rump; a short dark tail; pale-lined pointed ears (2026-11-08) The HORNS are the engine's sharp `horn` (sharp.js; tools/creaturegen/sharp/horns.py merged the field part and its slender detail tip into one centreline): smooth, sunk in the skull, a true point. (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): pointed upright LEAVES (sharp.js `fin`), pale in the hollow, the tips dark; the roots faired. (2026-11-08) The tail sits on a DOCK (`tailDock`, the rump's coat) grown out of the rump: it stood off it by a ~1 cm gap.",
